          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "उडी मारणे (uḍī mārṇe) is \"to strike a jump\": uḍī, \"a jump\", belongs with उडणे, \"to fly\" (CDIAL 1697), and मारणे comes from Sanskrit mārayati, \"kills\", whose Marathi form CDIAL glosses \"to strike, kill\" (CDIAL 10066)."
            }
          ]
        },
